; Direct cancellation by lambda via its witnessed divisibility of three.
; Embedded natural scalar cancellation follows componentwise from integers.
; These proofs avoid the full norm/domain dependency closure, keeping
; combined lambda libraries within unchanged default kernel work budgets.
